===Etymology===
From {{etyl|zhx|en}}, likely {{etyl|yue|en}} {{zh-l|三板|saam1 baan2}} or {{etyl|nan|en}} {{zh-l|舢舨|tr=[[sam-pán]]}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|nautical|lang=en}} A [[flat]]-[[bottom]]ed [[Chinese]] [[wooden]] [[boat]] propelled by two [[oar]]s.

